<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The walk in verse twenty-five means</l><l>“Marching in rank”,</l><l>“Keeping in step”,</l><l>Deliberately, purposefully</l><l>An ordered walk—to fulfill God’s goal.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Spirit Himself should be—</l><l>Our rule and our way,</l><l>Our principle, goal</l><l>Constantly, following</l><l>The inner sense—of life and peace.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
